comment: Category=organism-modification. Evidence=(ECO:0000250, based on PMID:1648219). Evidence=(ECO:0000250, based on UniProtKB:P31809). Evidence=(ECO:0000205, based on UniProtKB:P31809). Note: PMID:1648219 shows sequencing of mature N-terminus of Ceacam1 purified from Swiss Webster mice, but not specific to a sequence isoform; PMID:8896983 shows immunoblot showing native size of purified BgpA (Bgp1/4S) and BgpD (Bgp1/2S) and after N-glycanase treatment (Fig 2A); PMID:9867848 shows blots of a tyrosine phosphorylated Bgp1 form that migrates above the 116 kDa marker. Also show that tyrosine residues Tyr-488 and Tyr-515 in the C-terminus are required for the phosphorylation.
