id: PR:A9P558
name: granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor receptor subunit alpha isoform 3 (mouse)
namespace: protein
def: "A granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor receptor subunit alpha (mouse) that is a translation product of some mRNA whose exon structure and start site selection renders it capable of giving rise to a protein with the amino acid sequence represented by UniProtKB:A9P558. This isoform lacks the Fibronectin type-III (PS50853) domain and the region coding for the transmembrane domain." [GenBank:EF114318, GenPept:ABO38429, PMID:17694571, PRO:HJD]
comment: Category=organism-sequence. Evidence=(ECO:0000006, based on PMID:17694571, at protein level). Note: PMID:17694571 shows that this isoform may be produced from a transcript where inclusion of the fifth intron into the final transcript results in a premature stop codon.
