[Term]
id: PR:E9QPQ1
name: roundabout homolog 3 isoform ROBO3B.1 (mouse)
namespace: protein
def: "A roundabout homolog 3 isoform ROBO3B.1 that is encoded in the genome of mouse. This isoform has a shorter N-terminal sequence in comparison with ROBO3A isoforms and the C-terminal sequence arises from splicing of exon 26 to exon 27 and then to exon 28, with the resulting 78 amino acid peptide highly enriched in arginine/serine dipeptide repeats." [PMID:16554811, PMID:18466743, PRO:KRC]
